- Offline First (principle 2): [`../00-vision/02_Principles.md`](../00-vision/02_Principles.md)
- Canonical terminology (Knowledge Vault, Memory Provider, Provider): [`../00-vision/03_Glossary.md`](../00-vision/03_Glossary.md)
